    "## Task 2 — Router Node\n",
    "\n",
    "The router uses explicit rules instead of an unconstrained agent. Prediction language is checked first because phrases such as “who will win”, “beat”, “top-score”, and “predict” must never be mistaken for ordinary retrieval.\n",
    "\n",
    "The 20-query test below covers all four intent classes and an unsupported prediction example.\n"
   ]
