   "source": [
    "### Prediction tools\n",
    "\n",
    "Both Day 2 models are wrapped as tools. The match tool returns a probability plus the main feature differences used by the model. The top-player tool scores the available players from the requested team and converts the predicted fantasy-point scores into a relative probability distribution.\n",
    "\n",
    "The tools do **not** claim certainty. A probability is presented as model output, not as a guaranteed future result.\n"
   ]
  },
