    "## Task 4 — Retrieval, validation, fallback and clarification\n",
    "\n",
    "Validation checks the result before a prediction/retrieval answer can be formatted. Unknown teams, missing player data, unavailable future fixtures, and unsupported prediction types do not get guessed; they produce a clarification or fallback response.\n",
    "\n",
    "For “Pies vs Cats this week”, aliases resolve successfully, but the supplied data has no fixture after 2025-09-27, so the system asks for a date or a fixture contained in the data.\n"
