    "### Representative annotated state traces\n",
    "\n",
    "**Trace A — match prediction:** router → prediction tool → validation → formatter. The prediction tool returns a probability and feature grounding; the formatter adds explicit “not certain” language.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Trace B — retrieval:** router → retrieval tool → validation → formatter. The answer is produced only after the retrieval tool returns a valid dataset record.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Trace C — ambiguous/future fixture:** router → prediction tool → validation → clarification → formatter. The team aliases are resolved, but the missing 2026 fixture causes a clarification instead of a guessed date/opponent.\n"
   ]
